(58,'PLO 6','Develop and sustain intervention strategies and programs that promote the sustainable development goals for collaborative action and show respect to various social backgrounds, organizational dynamics, belief systems, and culture- and community-based perspectives.'),
(58,'PLO 7','Lead activities, programs, research, and interventions that promote social justice using behavioral scientific perspectives in line with the Lasallian core values of faith, service, and community.'),
