(315,'PLO 7','Work effectively and independently within multidisciplinary and multicultural teams, while clarifying and reflecting on personal values in relation to organizational culture, including considerations of faith and business practices.'),
(317,'PLO 1','Articulate and discuss the latest developments in the specific field of practice. (CHED 5)'),
