(323,'PLO 1','Analyze and interpret the latest trends in stakeholder behavior across diverse markets, applying relevant frameworks and research insights. Design and implement culturally sensitive, sustainable marketing strategies that integrate regional best practices and effectively communicate value to target audiences through oral, written, and digital channels.'),
(323,'PLO 2','Communicate and present plans through oral and written reports with effective use of communications platforms using industry standards and common marketing vocabulary understood by practitioners.'),
(323,'PLO 3','Promote the Filipino heritage by collaborating through service learning using the models on social responsibility and sustainability in the creation of products and services in the Philippines and in the ASEAN.'),
(323,'PLO 4','Design and develop comprehensive business plans for diverse markets, leveraging relevant frameworks and collaborating with multicultural stakeholders. Ensure plans adhere to ethical practices, consider cultural standards, and incorporate research to achieve collective goals.'),
(323,'PLO 5','Design and execute innovative, interdisciplinary business solutions for the diverse markets, integrating advanced professional skills, creativity, and an understanding of best practices and cultural contexts. Effectively communicate these solutions through oral, written, and digital means while adhering to ethical standards.'),
(324,'PLO 1','Synthesize advanced market research to produce a comprehensive analysis of current advertising trends.'),
