(326,'PLO 1','Analyze/Scan the environment to determine business opportunities and develop their profitability profiles from which a business plan can be produced, entrepreneurial ventures can be selected, or launched from existing organization/enterprises'),
(326,'PLO 2','Mobilize the necessary human, financial, logistical, and technical resources ethically in starting and managing a sustainable business venture.'),
