(391,'PLO 7','Develop leadership and agility through collaborative and creative industry training toward serving their community, nation, and world.'),
(391,'PLO 8','Examine various texts across genres and traditions to formulate their individual poetics that engage with and innovate existing cultural practices.'),
(391,'PLO 9','Write and disseminate creative texts that contribute to the formation of national literary identity and artistic heritage.');
